 JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md`.

+## Authentication and roles
+
+Every request carries `Authorization: Bearer <key>`, matched against `apiKeys`
+in the store.
+
+- `viewer`: read-only (`GET` routes, except `GET /audit`).
+- `cook`: everything `viewer` can do, plus `POST /recipes/:id/cook`,
+  `POST /batches/:id/waste`, `POST /temperatures`, and
+  `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`.
+- `manager`: all routes, including `GET /audit`.
+
+Missing or unknown keys answer `401` (`unauthorized`). Known keys without
+permission answer `403` (`forbidden`).
+
+Every request that changes data writes an audit entry (`at`, `keyName`,
+`method`, `path`, `status`), listed newest first by `GET /audit`.
+
 ## Errors

